 "about": "PROTOTYPE side-view horizontal slash (scripts/views/side-sword-v2-clips.ts), turned-side rig, near hand, facing screen-left; 30 fps, 21 frames (0.7 s), from and back to side_sword_ready. f1-f2 anticipation (2 frames): the fist draws back to the hip, the blade back and level at hip height, body drawn back 12 px, leaning back, weight on the back leg; f2-f3 the blade comes round (through the viewer: linear, under, never drawn); f3 contact (100 ms): forearm up-forward at chest height, the blade level toward the facing, 60 px lunge, lean in, front foot stepped, squash 0.975 x 1.02, `hit`, held to f5 (2-frame hitstop); f8 follow-through across: the blade carried round to the far side, behind the body, fist at the chest front; f12 recover; f21 ready. Item in front of everything f0.5-3.5 (the crescent passes in front of the chest), behind the body f5.5-10.5, otherwise under the holding arm. Thin swipe trail along the tip path f2.85-f3 (the last of the swing, rising to level in front of the chest), shown f2.5-f3.5.",
